630"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><header class="hero-section text-center py-5"><div class="container"><h1 class="display-4">Find the Perfect Robot Pool Cleaner</h1><p class="lead">Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips.</p><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/reviews">Read Reviews</a></div></header><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-8"><h2>Latest Articles</h2><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/robotic-pool-cleaner-weight-why-it-matters">Robotic Pool Cleaner Weight: Why It Matters More Than Most Buyers Realize</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Robotic pool cleaner weight affects cleaning performance, wall climbing, ease of removal, and long-term ownership. Learn how weight impacts real-world use and how to choose the right balance for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/robotic-pool-cleaner-weight-why-it-matters">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners">Corded vs Cordless Robotic Pool Cleaners: Which Is Right for Your Pool?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Corded and cordless robotic pool cleaners offer very different ownership experiences. Learn how power, runtime, convenience, and pool size affect which option is best for you.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/how-to-choose-the-right-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-your-pool">How to Choose the Right Robotic Pool Cleaner for Your Pool</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Choosing the right robotic pool cleaner depends on pool size, surface type, debris, and convenience preferences. This guide explains what actually matters and how to avoid common buying mistakes.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/how-to-choose-the-right-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-your-pool">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-dolphin-premier">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus vs Dolphin Premier: Which One Is Worth It?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>The Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus and Dolphin Premier are two of the most popular robotic pool cleaners on the market. Compare cleaning performance, filtration, wall climbing, maintenance, and value to determine which model is best for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-dolphin-premier">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners-for-large-pools">Corded vs Cordless Robotic Pool Cleaners for Large Pools</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Large pools place higher demands on robotic pool cleaners. This guide compares corded and cordless options specifically for larger pool sizes.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners-for-large-pools">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/polaris-vs-dolphin-robotic-pool-cleaners">Polaris vs Dolphin Robotic Pool Cleaners: Which Brand Is Better in 2026?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Compare Polaris and Dolphin robotic pool cleaners across cleaning performance, navigation, filtration, ease of use, value, and long-term ownership to decide which brand is right for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/polaris-vs-dolphin-robotic-pool-cleaners">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-large-pools">Best Robotic Pool Cleaner for Large Pools</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Large pools place higher demands on robotic pool cleaners. This guide explains what features matter most and highlights the best options for extended coverage and reliable performance.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-large-pools">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-deep-pools">Best Robotic Pool Cleaner for Deep Pools</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Deep pools pose unique challenges for robotic cleaners due to increased depth and vertical coverage. This guide highlights the best options and what features matter most.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-deep-pools">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus vs Polaris 9650iQ Sport: Which Should You Choose?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>A direct comparison of two popular robotic pool cleaners: the Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus and the Polaris 9650iQ Sport. Find out which one matches your needs.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/robotic-pool-cleaners-for-leaves-vs-fine-debris">Robotic Pool Cleaner for Leaves vs Fine Debris: What to Look For</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-01</p><p>Leaves and fine debris place very different demands on robotic pool cleaners. Learn how filtration, suction, and brush design affect real-world cleaning performance.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/robotic-pool-cleaners-for-leaves-vs-fine-debris">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/do-robotic-pool-cleaners-clean-walls-and-waterlines">Do Robotic Pool Cleaners Clean Walls and Waterlines?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-01-18</p><p>Not all robotic pool cleaners handle walls and waterlines the same way. Learn how wall climbing works, what waterline cleaning requires, and which features actually matter.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/do-robotic-pool-cleaners-clean-walls-and-waterlines">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/why-you-need-a-robot-pool-cleaner">Why You Need a Robot Pool Cleaner: A History of Clean</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-01-11</p><p>From manual scrubbing to autonomous robots: The history of pool cleaning and why a robot is cheaper than a service.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/why-you-need-a-robot-pool-cleaner">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/top-5-features-to-look-for">Top 5 Features to Look For in a Robot Pool Cleaner</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-01-04</p><p>Not all pool cleaners are created equal. Here are the top features you should consider before buying.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/top-5-features-to-look-for">Read More</a></article></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="p-4 mb-3 bg-light rounded"><h4>About Us</h4><p class="mb-0">We are passionate about finding the best products to make your life easier. Our reviews are unbiased and thorough.</p></div><div class="p-4"><h4>Quick Links</h4><ul class="list-unstyled"><li><a href="/best-of">Best of 2023</a></li><li><a href="/guides/maintenance-care">Troubleshooting</a></li><li><a href="/guides/cleaning-operation">Daily Routine</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4: